          "abridged": false,
          "description": "Tumble Media presents Yoga Kids Adventures. Join host and kids' yoga teacher Kathryn as she guides little yogis through four energizing adventures. Salute the sun and splash in the waves on a morning beach adventure to start your day with a smile. Head to the garden after school to smell flowers, squish through mud, and shake out the wiggles. Build strength and confidence deep in the jungle, where wild animals show you just how powerful your body can be. And when big feelings show up, follow the rainbow to explore every emotion with curiosity and kindness.\nEach adventure blends mindfulness, imaginative play, and movement into a routine kids will want to return to again and again. \n",
